  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The import export utility should be able to export BagIt bags into a serialized format when they have a profile which specifies serialization is required. This should support zip, tar, and tar+gzip initially.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Work can be done after ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3205#icft=FCREPO-3205"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      },
      {
       "text": " as serializing a bag after the fact does not change the structure of the bag itself, so if it is required a user can currently do it after the fact.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
